{
  "_design": [
    "Generated for the HCI study. Within-subjects: every participant does 1 practice task + 3 real tasks.",
    "Each real task has a different condition: tool on honest / tool on with a planted error / tool off (baseline).",
    "Condition per scenario is rotated with a 3x3 Latin square; task order is A (repeat, copy, reschedule) or B (reschedule, copy, repeat).",
    "Planted errors: repeat_dates and reschedule -> suggestion points at step 3 (first instruction); copy_names -> k of n overstated by 2.",
    "Feature 3 warnings (RQ4) are between-subjects: on for 3 and off for 3 participants in each group, balanced across squares.",
    "Everyone starts in Simple view and can switch. Needs STUDY_MODE=on and RELEASE_ACTIONS=on in .env.",
    "Keys starting with _ are notes for the researcher; the app ignores them."
  ],
